{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/266244-noble-and-eldrich-entitlements-in-changeling-2-0-questions","id":266244,"title":"Noble and Eldrich Entitlements in Changeling 2.0, questions?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-26T09:46:35-07:00","id":266244,"title":"Noble and Eldrich Entitlements in Changeling 2.0, questions?","content":"So how will Entitlements both noble and Eldrich work in Changeling 2.0?<br /> <br /> I was thinking that they make sense as tiers, noble entitlements work locally and Eldrich Entitlements are global conspiracies. (I think this was the idea in 1.0, but it would be good to be more explict about it).<br /> <br /> Anythoughts on how it should work in 2.0?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T09:04:00-07:00","id":266781,"title":"","content":"I remember that Eldrich Entitlements were more powerful in general then Noble Entitlements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-27T15:05:10-07:00","id":267026,"title":"","content":"You mean giving the Entitlements their own Contracts with clauses unlocked as your Mantle rises? Seems a pretty nifty idea. I would keep the rating for an Entitlement to be gained as the Wyrd rating though, as otherwise having Mantle 3 unlocking an Entitlement negates there needing to have a clause 2&amp;3 unlocked on the Entitlement's Contract when you get it.<br /> <br /> Also... I think Mantle should really be more of a prerequisite for the Entitlements that are unique to the specific Courts... The Courtless should have their own Neutral Entitlements still. Though perhaps they could gain access to other Entitlements through Court Goodwills?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T10:19:56-07:00","id":267495,"title":"","content":"Perhaps y'know where they mentioned rumours about the Entitlements in their write-ups, that there could be a linked Mystery Cult that a member could buy into with Merits once they joined? Or would that be too complex? I do kinda like the idea of an Entitlement Mantle (especially as Entitlements do affect the Mien, just like Mantles do) or like you say, perhaps membership into a small grouping of Mystery Cults (all listed in the Chronicle book, perhaps 5 say) that would act as a prerequisite to more powerful Entitlements?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}